meta {
  name: Delete Truck
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/trucks/{{truckId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Soft-deletes one truck (`TruckResource.deleteTruck`, `common/controller/TruckResource.java:233`,
  service `TruckService.deleteTruck`). Roles: VAHN_ADMIN, TORG_ADMIN, FUND_MANAGER, TRUCK_MANAGER.
  Non-VAHN_ADMIN callers can only delete trucks owned by their own torg.

  Set `truckId` (and `accessToken`) in the selected environment before each run.

  204 on success. 404 "Vehicle not found" if the id doesn't exist or is already deleted.
  400 if the truck is VERIFIED (verified trucks can't be deleted) or belongs to another torg.
}
